bound-lock/1 about="Bind a package release with the pipeline views. Bind a page to its receipts with view/readme. Refuse a dependency drift with dep pins. Ask a second head that must agree." at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/learn sig="ed25519:era1:6WSr6EK1xtRgp4nCwS/4Jor7iPHJjsUeIWx9erKTGbo4HdVOr3s2N/1s6bcjU7dty/czmq0rPOzE2hk2CGxxCg==" value=present
