bound-lock/1 about="No fourth verb. A batch lands whole or not at all. A bound nobody has a reading for is refused. A changed byte of a signed line does not verify. Bound does not know whether a claim is true in the world: it knows who signed what, and whether the ranges meet." at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/refuses/lead sig="ed25519:era1:1MZclSkdc+VBacphsX0huaKnsMvWGn6KuYha5kVzOt4q9NsR7MvawiVwRsafPYweY19EY4SlRZpDd899oTgYCg==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="What rests on it" at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/rested/heading sig="ed25519:era1:DG28YlYj0hO8xo57olbizcc/7VstOU6QSL7gUfT08ktsZKABrAtXFS4VB035PklArX2ZtU4LMnR1VxqX5LvgDQ==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="What it rests on" at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/rests/heading sig="ed25519:era1:izutAAoPwV37CvCEGBWvM8vUNmBcTDs56rImNDvIYAJulG4t448CRL1t/M/Li7O4gvCCFB6oXBqtf4pZUoYTAQ==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="obligations is the meet. topos is the line. Worlds outside bound read a calendar, a package, a page. Bound reads lines, folds them, lands what was signed, and signs." at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/rests/on sig="ed25519:era1:0hFhkf9ILnW58+uch7TLQvuVb7487W/7ipuHYaTqgcLMp0fFrc0VIkNrmafmnnw27NYuwz2yz5e81iWg0w4fAA==" value=present
bound-lock/1 about="A fold, live" at=policy:bound/door by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/seq/heading sig="ed25519:era1:qWwmXgZ4V2k+PMXsseuhBZsXmtlE4bFpRynpiti4EK4fOQHOWFFTfXuQI+eEKaP4o9k6pnWIQPjcm85imbfZCg==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="A lock is the set of lines a place is bound by. A receipt is what a reader saw. The fold is their meet. Each line carries scope, role, form, measure, value, needs, at, by, epoch, sig." at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/the-object sig="ed25519:era1:6nPCQGvLIvvaKCN4kZuQ7jDSUAbZy9EXcalqk/hApM3NRBE7HZxGn5oHh9s71VwWMX/kA0D+vS/7hjrIBlMeBA==" value=present
bound-lock/1 about="The object" at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/the-object/heading sig="ed25519:era1:0Ae+S35k5c/upjJo0LPoZfAaoPDWcx55RRfy/3uiVYyLy28J9rgeLkd6SraE3bQzmqMJpJMC6hjWw8oY4WD6CA==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="The paper" at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/the-paper/heading sig="ed25519:era1:USg/cyc2u9ypbE3IBxgJtsWH2Yv/FzckVs3GTUOX3omIV3t2sZcnBtAFi8ZDdzL9syskszIYnVr/1Y8D04LMCw==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="bound folds what was bound: signed bounds, folded by one algebra, refused when they fork." at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/what sig="ed25519:era1:kzcohB9CQfcgE3Rg/xgODW8kMZMWxhNOblCHYoJl3ZTpjans9XE2m0t2M0RXULYInjSWv5N72bvRLBTS7ZGGDA==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about={sentence} at=policy:bound/readme by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/what-holds/axiom sig="ed25519:era1:HpehOtq4PM2ThIgUERpdg7Fr6QR1LgiwzbZy+3C9x+MPjZfx0v1iSdJyoWNwD4hhSylhqmJ6aZjLo7nDUNI8Aw==" value=present
bound-lock/1 about="What holds" at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/what-holds/heading sig="ed25519:era1:+q+qSU+UeAAuZ6Hz+I1+4owUhAfJz7lQHIyQghTD+ijbc6SRc/4s82Uo9IXB59oxPNcaki8HG5xJiB/dgM6mBA==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Joining two files is putting their lines together: order does not matter, and a line twice is still one. A disagreement does not break the merge; it shows as CONFLICT. A file travels alone. Bound never guesses: one origin is REQUIRED, not FREE. Each of these is a test in bound/test/laws.test.ts." at=policy:bound/010 by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/what-holds/lead sig="ed25519:era1:817Xtjhucjgf6XLvk6BQYFF4AYIXEZaT4y2O3cL0vU9OuvRVij37g0L25U1l2LJyyEYzKCe8G/2A81uFDa4jCQ==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 at=policy:bound/publish by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=publish/keys sig="ed25519:era1:x3Dr6lJDyXKbkE8yNsTZ5vqHnVqNvJwbiZwnrukmDAFpuYvnSHoP2o0cNc6+je4pVl9de3qE7DNldt2+9gG1CQ==" value=authorize|attest|read
bound-lock/1 at=place:bound by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=publish/takes sig="ed25519:era1:QXAyLWNOQ3BpMsepWP636rM/MtGtVC8lWgV8UfFrhMfjZlQ686su04RMVU12NM1/u6sR86CwyHka3YNrePtqBg==" value=audit/wire/*/**|keys/owner/**|region/*/**|cites/*/**|leaf-role/*/**|notation/*/**|form/*/**|media/**|prose/*/cell/meet|prose/*/cell/together|prose/*/cell/outlier|prose/*/figure/world/*|open/*/**|theme|license
bound-lock/1 about="A new snapshot has a new evidence identity, not automatically a new independent origin. Preserve the admitted attribution and the chosen Topos's independence contract. Repeated readings, time periods, signing devices and receipt copies must not manufacture freedom." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/01 sig="ed25519:era1:WRtRfVGdzjrSBcm/71TLideUL3InP2o04Nv5Y6yjAyHLUfJ2BheiyPqPXcdyNNdQHLdaF8ZTQ1gdLDCrLyi9BA==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Algebraic vacuity, absence of observations and lack of recent activity are separate facts. A view may expose inactivity over an admitted window, but cannot rename it algebraic vacuity or read missing history as zero." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/02 sig="ed25519:era1:Eri1bifgE8lPbm+aeDrgtV4W1conPueh52pLrNg5fLJQwo43XAqJp7s1Wbbe/thJnVs6oAlJYWQy1IAQNZbuCA==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Exchange cost requires units: transferred regions, payload bytes, protocol overhead and verification work. Reused regions transfer zero semantic payload. Variable-size regions cannot obey a byte ceiling stated merely as a count of open regions." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/03 sig="ed25519:era1:IsdlYdwdITAbmggra1ZdGTJmWHca2pm6Ul5I9oQEUnA5r+ejKo5kfcgbSAJKC3u6d4ai6i7y6kKTIzH1ldphDw==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Zero port invocations applies to selection/help, receipt-only check, prospective evaluation and signing's observation/execution ports. Signing necessarily invokes its declared signer. A shaped render, observation or admitted verification request may execute its explicitly requested provider under the relevant contract. Never hide execution behind a purported inspection command." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/04 sig="ed25519:era1:P3i43rUuhaapgUWCcUvrQc2FRX7xnfnqekg+6srm4uj3rfITQdeWYydtcVBb1bwQvHWuha4xgAmdc8j9Xl2oBw==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="A port's digest identifies executable bytes, not permission to execute them. Coverage, request authority, bounds, framing and resource dependencies are checked separately. `port/**` coverage is a proposed namespace policy to admit, not an existing universal authority rule." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/05 sig="ed25519:era1:iwukABEKb7Y7QxfDxHhO2L3sbOLO7Am/0AkiC2lut/sx1IPHm/Sid9ZN3T6VS6kGBZEGQIr2ercTsPYxGwe9Ag==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Deterministic repair means a reproducible proposed lot, not automatic human approval. A red can lack measurements, authority, a witness or a unique repair. Such a case returns an explicit unmet requirement; it never invents a paying line." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/06 sig="ed25519:era1:O0So6rFE5LUh8nsR9s5h9m3488RDILfslhlItRY4hXx8PxmoZT3p74FyAOIvGlWP9MBMo4UzWDmuacL8Xk6uCg==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="Not every existing export needs removal because its docs are incomplete. Inventory supported package exports, CLI verbs/views, record families and provider-facing protocols. Distinguish documented public surface from internal implementation files; review accidental published subpaths. Withdraw public support through an explicit compatibility decision, not by erasing history or inventing new verbs." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/07 sig="ed25519:era1:ypFIJAwEJkKNwc4cV6xBxobDKyQukLukTc80idoOhjJuLgB/lsMludj4miIZrDjSeX+9QrpOJE9jDo5vjCvaDA==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="The proposed laws are not already paid merely because this text names them. Inventory actual standing lines and current evidence first. New laws, category links and grammar require named admission acts. Obligations remains unchanged." at=policy:bound/015-plan by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/08 sig="ed25519:era1:S/cJCcBJpjfeHlbDNVZZAjxfLVUq5hh1a1HIBblSNXZhofzZ4xnpZmelMoFRmxK1NWrR/wbvatAGiZRtTTGADQ==" value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="A sequence of declared readings is not an indivisible act. Preserve total pass time as a diagnostic; measure each reading and host invocation, account for unpartitioned work, keep refusals and the 60-second ceiling unchanged." at=witness:declared-act-cost by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/015/cost-boundary sig="ed25519:era1:dRhPprQCZqNCPX4yNNxM3BUupzhEq1zjpb8Imt9mjWv1G3bYMBNeSwSyLIGAy6ByDCBQUiNu5q/ULQAqWCdnDg==" value=present
bound-lock/1 about="The six unmounted read-only catalog entries have no current product imports or render selection and were retired; separately selected historical artifact bindings remain intact. CI tests the installed host boundaries, current reading identity and package build without local draft inputs. Whole-repository self-closure is not a product test or a paid release verdict: it remains an explicit unpaid demand until its worlds have public verified deliveries and current portable receipts. No numeric ceiling, authority check, executable-closure check or historical receipt identity is changed." at=policy:bound/019-minimum-ci-scope by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/019/minimum-ci-scope sig="ed25519:era1:S+5T5pLGAzrGtcC2pf2phvvxcAiR4/E4K6A0nOKpb3TvtDuXrCmrAzhDc2VgTUNHRhMp+s/ayA7dUI6tyzPRBg==" value=present
bound-lock/1 about="The fourteen proposed local-mirror source URLs were withdrawn after their draft inputs were removed. Selected standing and runtime digests remain unchanged. No matching public world delivery has been verified for those bytes; clean native closure remains unpaid. Public sources must deliver the exact selected bytes, or an explicit reviewed world release and re-pin is required; no newest-by-URL or local-store substitution." at=policy:bound/019-public-source-ci by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/019/public-source-delivery sig="ed25519:era1:zKic5fIxxVBlF1EPBjzB8RMod8y9Wof06kszNf46A+Zpi7FcmJeBOGtVuIRVXEredqf0vsVgF4sMNRl+ldrACA==" value=present
bound-lock/1 about="The host adapter parses literal JavaScript imports when identifying the implementation behind receipts. It executes no module and does not inventory domain exports, duplicates or literals. It does not enforce arbitrary dynamic-import closure or claim a capsule sandbox." at=policy:host-module-identity by=owner epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/host/module-parser sig="ed25519:era1:i6YRPJId1xOjqBpIr+RXx7giSukpJe2dmv1UA48KGiki41vO/C+olGG6q0gydafEl9SE0Shorl6pNvwM43rSDg==" value=present
